 "On rédige le pacte d'associés (qui organise pouvoirs, cessions, sorties), on modifie les statuts (création des actions de préférence) et on prépare les bulletins de souscription. Les grands principes de la term sheet deviennent ici des obligations précises. Le pacte est confidentiel ; les statuts sont publics et opposables aux tiers.": "You draft the shareholders' agreement (which organises powers, transfers and exits), amend the articles (creating the preference shares) and prepare the subscription forms. The broad principles of the term sheet become precise obligations here. The shareholders' agreement is confidential; the articles are public and enforceable against third parties.",
