 "Fixe comment les associés décident (majorités, quorum, consultation).": "Sets how the shareholders take decisions (majorities, quorum, consultation).",
 "Fixe comment les parties se notifient officiellement (adresse, forme, délais).": "Sets how the parties give each other formal notice (address, form, deadlines).",
 "Fixe la date butoir du closing (signature des actes + versement des fonds).": "Sets the long-stop date for closing (signature of the deeds + payment of the funds).",
