 "Chaque relecture engage la responsabilité personnelle de l'avocat, via une lettre de mission nominative et son assurance responsabilité civile professionnelle (RCP). C'est pourquoi vous savez toujours qui relit vos documents — et pouvez en changer.": "Each review puts the lawyer's personal liability on the line, through a named engagement letter and their professional indemnity insurance. That is why you always know who is reviewing your documents — and can change them.",
